0012                  (            os9.d):01045         FMREAD              RMB       3                   Read from File
0015                  (            os9.d):01046         FMWRIT              RMB       3                   Write to File
0018                  (            os9.d):01047         FMRDLN              RMB       3                   ReadLn
001B                  (            os9.d):01048         FMWRLN              RMB       3                   WritLn
